\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  The Lord is my redeemer,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I fear no enemy
\par He listens to my prayer,
\par And gives me comfort still.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Say He, if you are my sheep,
\par Have ears for my word only;
\par \i ://:And I too will drive away
\par Those that want you destroyed. ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Of this fact I truly know,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And of it I rejoice;
\par That the Lord, God Almighty
\par Takes lasting care of me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\ulnone\b0 
\par It's He that gives me support,\cf0 
\par He drives away my foes,
\par \i ://:He stays with me, redeems me
\par  And wants me live in peace. ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. I praise my Saviour Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And hope for His goodness;
\par Where Jesus not my great friend,
\par Were Jesus not in me;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Never would I be able
\par To stand before the judge,
\par \i ://:And I'd have my recompense,
\par From that condemnation. ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   My sins and attendant woes
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Jesus has cleared for me;
\par It was to clear my sins that
\par His blood was shed for me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It was His blood that He did use
\par To wash my soul pure white;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\i ://:Before I could be at peace
\par  And live in happiness. ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   He gives me consolation
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And makes my pain abate;
\par The worries of our life here
\par Have naught to frighten me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par The spirit gives evidence
\par Enough within my heart,
\par \i ://:That troubles of our life here
\par Don't match heaven's glories. ://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   Cause you this earth to crumble,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 My Jesus stands supreme;
\par His pow'r never gets used up,
\par His love for me don't cease.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My foes cannot wrestle  me
\par Out of the hands of God.
\par \i ://:I'll cling daily to Jesus,
\par \pard     With Him forever live ://:\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

